/S /H3
/T (Objective: The period workshops aimed to raise awareness and educate both school girls and women of MIJWAN WELFRE SOCIETY \(the rural village of MIJWAN, Phoolpur, Azamgarh, UP India\) on menstrual health and hygiene. This initiative sought to empower the community by breaking down taboos surrounding menstruation and providing essential knowledge and resources to manage their periods safely and confidently.)
/E (Objective: The period workshops aimed to raise awareness and educate both school girls and women of MIJWAN WELFRE SOCIETY \(the rural village of MIJWAN, Phoolpur, Azamgarh, UP India\) on menstrual health and hygiene. This initiative sought to empower the community by breaking down taboos surrounding menstruation and providing essential knowledge and resources to manage their periods safely and confidently.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
>>
