/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The period workshops have made a significant impact by raising awareness, educating, and empowering women and girls of MIJWAN WELFARE SOCIETY. Through education and community engagement, we have taken vital steps toward breaking taboos and promoting safe and dignified menstrual health practices. The workshops successfully educated and empowered young girls by equipping them with yoga asanas, a vital aspect of pain management in Periods. )
/E (The period workshops have made a significant impact by raising awareness, educating, and empowering women and girls of MIJWAN WELFARE SOCIETY. Through education and community engagement, we have taken vital steps toward breaking taboos and promoting safe and dignified menstrual health practices. The workshops successfully educated and empowered young girls by equipping them with yoga asanas, a vital aspect of pain management in Periods. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [0]
>>
